Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Auditing Protein-Dynamics Models with Structural Nulls", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.997330312945943*^9, {3.9973337744001217`*^9, 
   3.9973337760272083`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a6bde979-20f1-418c-b9c3-\
b621ecd23db4"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook reconstructs a homology-aware protein-dynamics benchmark from \
frozen residue-level predictions. It verifies the reported Macro-H result \
against the original stored results and tests whether the signal disappears \
under scrambled-data controls.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.997330401347363*^9},ExpressionUUID->"f1ebb8a4-8c2c-4f0f-8a68-\
6836c71f0862"],

Cell["\<\
Does adding static contact-graph information improve residue-level \
protein-dynamics prediction beyond an angular-only structural baseline when \
performance is evaluated across homology-aware ECOD H-groups?\
\>", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.9973304565412483`*^9, {3.9973305255534573`*^9, 
   3.9973305294664373`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b19b842c-fbd8-4fe4-abb8-\
e66e8ab46d39"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Data and Provenance", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9973305389596567`*^9, 
  3.997330545506836*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ab50dba6-ff8b-4576-989a-\
34391f6db605"],

Cell["\<\
The analysis uses 2,000 frozen held-out residue predictions drawn from 100 \
proteins, with exactly 20 sampled residues per protein. Proteins are assigned \
to 59 ECOD H-groups for homology-aware aggregation. No models are retrained \
in this notebook; it reconstructs statistics from persisted experimental \
outputs.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.997330564026329*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0e5ab593-4f6e-4b1d-b01f-\
777408e73c3e"],

